  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: probe of let y = { x = g(n); x + 1 }; h({ x = g(n); x }) still gives L3 def=[y] use=[x,n,x] and L4 def=[] use=[x,n,x]; DDG chains x from 'let mut x = 0' to the final use (false dependence). The description's aside is fixed: let z = if c { x = g(n); 1 } else { 2 } now defines z and records x = g(n) as its own statement defining x (WI-faful done). MECHANISM: Rust extractor reads a block expression's inner assignment target as a use, never a definition. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-ruhuv."  # 2c17
